  dictionaries (meta/spell), embedded in crates/ide/data/spell with their LICENSE.

EmmyLuaCodeStyle
  https://github.com/CppCXY/EmmyLuaCodeStyle
  Copyright (c) 2022 CppCXY
  The formatter (crates/fmt) and its test cases.

fivem-lls-addon
